  <title>Product search</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>General</gui><gui>Product search</gui></guiseq> lists every
  product once for each vendor that sells it, with that vendor's
  <gui>Order number</gui> and <gui>Vendor barcode</gui>. It is the quickest way
  to find a product from the number on a vendor's box.</p>

  <p>Type into the search boxes above the columns: product name, ext name,
  barcode, vendor, order number or vendor barcode. Every word typed must be
  found in its column. The <gui>S</gui>, <gui>S</gui>, <gui>P</gui> and
  <gui>M</gui> columns show whether a product is stocked, sellable,
  purchasable and manufactured.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>Right click a product for its <gui>Product hub</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Drag a product onto an invoice or purchase order to add it
    there.</p></item>
    <item><p>When a product is changed elsewhere, <gui>Refresh</gui> appears;
    click it to reload the list.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Save window layout</gui>, in the window menu, remembers the
    window's size and column widths on this computer.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
